flf2a$ 6 5 33 0 5 0 64 96
Helvetica/Arial Braille (helvetica-braille.flf)
A 6-row Unicode Braille FIGlet font modeled after Helvetica / Arial.
Each character cell uses 2x4 Unicode Braille patterns (U+2800..U+28FF)
for a 24-dot vertical grid (rows 0..4 above baseline, row 5 descenders).
Includes ASCII (32-126), German umlauts, and full ISO Latin-1 (160-255).
